<title>FRANCE: Paribas sells 3.5 pct of Havas.</title>
<headline>Paribas sells 3.5 pct of Havas.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>French financial holding company Paribas has sold in the market its remaining 3.5 percent of French media group Havas, officials at the two groups said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;Paribas has totally exited from our capital,&quot; said Nicolas Duhamel, financal managing director of Havas, responding to a question from Reuters about possible changes in the the group's shareholder structure.</p>
<p>&quot;We confirm having sold our stake in Havas in the market,&quot; said a Paribas spokesman, declining to give further details.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
